s expose us to credit risk to the extent that the counterparties may be unable to meet the terms of the arrangement. We seek to mitigate such risk by limiting our counterparties to, and by spreading the risk across, major financial institutions. In addition, the potential risk of loss with any one counterparty resulting from this type of credit risk is monitored on an ongoing basis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:DerivativeInstrumentsAndHedgingActivitiesDisclosureTextBlock>\n    <us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract contextRef=\"c-135\" id=\"f-820\">P1M</us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract>\n    <us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract contextRef=\"c-136\" id=\"f-821\">P1Y</us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract>\n    <us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract contextRef=\"c-137\" id=\"f-822\">P24M</us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract>\n    <us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount contextRef=\"c-138\" decimals=\"INF\" id=\"f-823\" unitRef=\"usd\">400000000</us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount>\n    <us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract contextRef=\"c-139\" id=\"f-824\">P3Y</us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract>\n    <us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract contextRef=\"c-140\" id=\"f-825\">P5Y</us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract>\n    <us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract contextRef=\"c-141\" id=\"f-826\">P10Y</us-gaap:DerivativeTermOfContract>\n    <us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount contextRef=\"c-142\" decimals=\"INF\" id=\"f-827\" unitRef=\"usd\">1000000000.0</us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount>\n    <us-gaap:ForeignCurrencyCashFlowHedgeGainLossToBeReclassifiedDuringNext12Months contextRef=\"c-3\" decimals=\"-6\" id=\"f-828\" unitRef=\"usd\">-10000000</us-gaap:ForeignCurrencyCashFlowHedgeGainLossToBeReclassifiedDuringNext12Months>\n    <us-gaap:InterestRateCashFlowHedgeGainLossToBeReclassifiedDuringNext12MonthsNet contextRef=\"c-3\" decimals=\"-6\" id=\"f-829\" unitRef=\"usd\">6000000</us-gaap:InterestRateCashFlowHedgeGainLossToBeReclassifiedDuringNext12MonthsNet>\n    <us-gaap:ScheduleOfDerivativeInstrumentsInStatementOfFin