family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\"&gt;During the three and nine months ended September&#160;30, 2026, we paid a total of $138 million and $415 million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\"&gt;in cash dividends, respectively, compared to $132 million and $400 million paid during the same periods in 2025. In October 2026, our Audit Committee declared a cash dividend of $0.31 per share of common stock to be paid on December&#160;18, 2026 to stockholders of record as of December&#160;4, 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteDisclosureTextBlock>\n    <ebay:CommonStockSharesIssuedNotDisclosed contextRef=\"c-3\" id=\"f-1244\">true</ebay:CommonStockSharesIssuedNotDisclosed>\n    <ebay:StockRepurchaseProgramAdditionalAmountAuthorized contextRef=\"c-323\" decimals=\"-8\" id=\"f-1245\" unitRef=\"usd\">2000000000.0</ebay:StockRepurchaseProgramAdditionalAmountAuthorized>\n    <srt:StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount1 contextRef=\"c-55\" decimals=\"-8\" id=\"f-1246\" unitRef=\"usd\">5000000000.0</srt:StockRepurchaseProgramAuthorizedAmount1>\n    <us-gaap:ScheduleOfTreasuryStockByClassTextBlock contextRef=\"c-1\" id=\"f-1247\">&lt;div style=\"margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:27pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%\"&gt;The following table presents stock repurchase activity under our stock repurchase programs for the period indicated (in millions, except per share amounts):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=\"text-align:center\"&gt;&lt;table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:99.853%\"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=\"width:1.0%\"&gt;&lt